OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fscattered showers alongside strong
OL,7,Fnorthwesterly winds which will
OL,8,Fgradually decrease through the night.
OL,9,FTurning mainly dry later with some
OL,10,Fclear spells for Shetland, but Orkney
OL,11,Fcloudier.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA risk of patchy rain early
OL,14,Ffor Orkney and a few showers for
OL,15,FShetland, otherwise largely dry with
OL,16,Fsome sunny spells. Breezy, fresh west
OL,17,For northwest winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
